# One address for the site, so canonical tags, hreflang alternates, the
# sitemap and what visitors actually see all agree on gag.golf.
https://www.gag.golf/*  https://gag.golf/:splat  301

# The site lived at its Cloudflare Pages subdomain before the domain was
# registered, and that address was shared with the client and the committee.
https://great-lakes-sports.pages.dev/*  https://gag.golf/:splat  301

# The second locale was briefly published under /zh before the client set the
# language policy. Those URLs were live and listed in the sitemap, so they are
# redirected rather than left to 404 for anyone who opened or bookmarked one.
/zh          /fr            301
/zh/*        /fr/:splat     301

# The Brand page was folded into About when the site was rebuilt around the
# youth-platform positioning, which has no separate brand section.
/brand       /about         301
/fr/brand    /fr/about      301
